OL,3,GNEWSAForty five Scottish police
OL,4,Aofficers suspended over alleged crimes
OL,5,Aagainst women
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice Scotland has said 45 serving
OL,8,Fofficers are currently suspended over
OL,9,Fallegations of violence against women
OL,10,Fand girls.
OL,12,FChief constable Jo Farrell said she
OL,13,Fexpected more would face sanctions over
OL,14,Ftheir behaviour following a spate of
OL,15,Fformer officers being convicted for
OL,16,Fsexual offences.
OL,18,FFarrell said a review into the handling
OL,19,Fof the case surrounding officer Alan
OL,20,FGreer ` who was exposed as a serial
OL,21,Frapist after taking his own life ` was
OL,22,Funder way.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
